Subject: [PATCH] webui: interpret AMI Aptio V POST codes and boot progress

Replace per-row export/download actions with a wrapping description column.
Use the same reference catalog as the boot-progress service, distinguish
errors and ambiguous ACPI meanings, and explicitly report unmatched codes.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD firmware reference]

